# PyCharm
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
.idea/

.vscode/

# --- Thesis external-dependency additions (2026-09-14 fix pass) ---
# external/PersistBench/ and external/privacy-collapse/ are vendored tool
# checkouts, each its own git repository. They must NEVER be `git add`-ed as
# (superseded 2026-10-17: external/ repos are now registered as git submodules, see .gitmodules;
# the earlier note below described the ignore-based alternative)
# plain directories (git would silently create dangling "embedded repository"
# gitlinks, breaking the checkout for anyone who clones this repo). Exact
# provenance (URL, pinned commit, thesis patch) is recorded instead at
# thesis/manifests/external_dependencies/external_dependencies.tsv and
# thesis/patches/; thesis/scripts/setup_external_dependencies.sh recreates
# these working copies from that record. None of the three paths below are
# affected by this rule since they live under thesis/, not external/.

# --- Thesis cleanup migration additions (2026-09-14) ---
# Large HF model-weight caches and generated hidden-state/representation tensors
# produced by the mechanistic-analysis code (mechanistic/ stays in place; only its
# generated artifacts are excluded here, not its source).
mechanistic/**/model_cache/
mechanistic/**/representations/

# Redundant supervisor-reporting snapshot bundle: everything remaining under
# supervisor_update/ after the 2026-09-14 migration is either a byte-identical copy
# of a file that now lives in thesis/ or research_history/, or a redundant tar.gz of
# the same directory. See thesis_cleanup_audit/DELETE_CANDIDATES_FINAL.md. Nothing
# here was deleted; this only stops it from being newly committed.
/supervisor_update/

# Corrupted/oversized archives at repo root (see thesis_cleanup_audit/DELETE_CANDIDATES_FINAL.md)
/*.tar.gz

# .bak/.before_* snapshot files are ignored by default (they are typically ad hoc,
# uncommitted editor backups), EXCEPT the two locations where this thesis
# deliberately keeps small .bak snapshots as tracked historical evidence.
*.bak*
*.before_*
!research_history/03_checkpoint_selection_development/trainer_snapshots/*
!thesis/docs/persistbench_patch_history/*
# Submission cleanup (2026-10-17): defense-only / scratch material kept on disk, not submitted
/FINAL_DEFENSE_SLIDE_BLUEPRINT.md
